WEBVTT

00:15:28.328 --> 00:15:32.960
Now, we see the creation of a new
massive class of useless people.

00:15:32.984 --> 00:15:33.985
(Laughter)

00:15:34.009 --> 00:15:39.370
As computers become better and better
in more and more fields,

00:15:39.394 --> 00:15:44.286
there is a distinct possibility that
computers will out-perform us

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:47.913
in most tasks and will make
humans redundant.

00:15:47.937 --> 00:15:50.674
And then the big political
and economic question

00:15:50.698 --> 00:15:53.061
of the 21st century will be,

00:15:53.085 --> 00:15:55.247
"What do we need humans for?",

00:15:55.271 --> 00:15:58.638
or at least, "What do we need
so many humans for?"

00:15:58.662 --> 00:16:01.120
BG: Do you have an answer in the book?